  "content": "[Intro]\n[Em]\n[Em]\n[Am]  [Bm]\n[Em]\n[Am]  [Bm]\n[C#m]\n[F#m]  [G#m]\n[C#m]\n[F#m]  [G#m]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C#m]For whom the gun [F#m]tolls\n[C#m]For whom the [Cm]prey weeps\n[C#m]Bow before a [F#m]war\n[C#m]Call it religion\n[F#m]Some wounds never [Bm]heal\n[F#m]Some tears [E]never [B]will\n[F#m]Dry for the [Bm]unkind\n[F#m]Cry for mankind\n[C#m]Even the dead [F#m]cry\n[C#m]Their only [Cm]comfort\n[C#m]Kill your friend, I don`t care [F#m]\n[C#m]Orchid kids, blinded stare\n[F#m]Need to [Bm]understand\n[F#m]No need [E]to [B]forgive\n[F#m]No truth no [Bm]sense\n[F#m]left to be followed\n\n[Bridge]\n[C#m]\n[F#m]  [G#m]\n[C#m]\n[F#m]  [G#m]\n[C#m]\n[D]\n[Em]\n[G]\n[Em]\n[D]  [C]\n[Em]\n[G]  [Am]\n[Em]\n[D]  [B]\n\n[Interlude]\n[Em]  [D]\n[Em]\n[Em]  [D]\n[Em]  [Am]  [D#m]\n[Em]  [D]\n[Em]  [Am]  [D]\n[Em]  [D]\n[Em]  [Am]  [D#m]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C#m]\"Facing this unbearable\nfear like meeting an old\n[G#m]friend\"\n[C#m]\"In this world of a million reli-\ngions everyone prays the same\n[G#m]way\"\n[Em]  [D]\n[Em]  [Am]  [D]\n[Em]  [D]\n[Em]  [Am]  [D#m]\n[C#m]\"Father help me,\nsave me a place by your\n[G#m]side!\"\n[C#m]\n[E]  [F#m]\n[C#m]\"Drunk with the blood of your   victims\n[B]I do feel [A]your pitywanting\n[C#m]pain, Lust for fame, a deadly game\"\n[E]  [F#m]\n[C#m]\"Good wombs\n[B]hath borne bad [G#]sons...\"\n[C#m]Cursing, God, why? [F#m]\n[C#m]Falling for every [G#]lie\n[C#m]Survivors` guilt [F#m]\n[C#m]In us [G]forevermore\n[F#m]Fifteen candles [Bm]\n[F#m]Redeemers [E]of this [B]   world\n[F#m]Dwell in hypocrisy: [Bm]\n[F#m]\"How were we supposed to know?\"",
